    ('<li>点选项即选中该宠物，点切换按钮只翻转该选项的方向（两个图标左右互换、箭头随之换向，切换按钮转 180° 并变蓝底）；录音进行中切换会被提示先结束录音。切换有平滑过渡，录音按钮按压缩放反馈。</li>', '<li>Tap option to select that pet, tap switch button to flip only that option\'s direction (two icons swap left-right, arrow changes direction accordingly, switch button rotates 180° and turns blue background); switching during recording prompts to end recording first. Switch has smooth transition, recording button press compression feedback.</li>'),
    ('<li>图标：切换 / 狗 / 人类 / 猫 四个图标取自 Font Awesome v5 实体库（repeat / dog / cat / user-alt），SVG 路径已内联进 app.js，不引 CDN、不依赖外部字体；空态插画的宠物剪影会随所选宠物切换。配色：暖橙主色承担宠物与操作，Logo 蓝（#2165b0）承担「人」侧图标、播放键、View Pet Health Report 等跨模块入口，页面另有右上冷色 / 左下暖色的低透明度冲洗，两者混合不抢主体。</li>', '<li>Icons: Switch / Dog / Human / Cat four icons from Font Awesome v5 solid library (repeat / dog / cat / user-alt), SVG paths inlined into app.js, no CDN, no external font dependency; empty state illustration pet silhouette switches with selected pet. Color scheme: warm orange main color for pet and operation, Logo blue (#2165b0) for "human" side icons, play button, View Pet Health Report and other cross-module entries; page also has top-right cool color / bottom-left warm color low-opacity wash, both mixed without stealing the main subject.</li>'),
    ('<div class="callout"><h3>状态演示（仅原型）</h3><p>以下按钮用于演示异常状态，不影响真实流程。</p><div class="doc-demo-row"><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="nosound">无声音</button><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="error">权限失败</button><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="idle">恢复空闲</button></div></div>', '<div class="callout"><h3>Status demo (prototype only)</h3><p>Buttons below for demo of exception status, do not affect real flow.</p><div class="doc-demo-row"><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="nosound">No sound</button><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="error">Permission failed</button><button data-action="trans-demo" data-value="idle">Restore idle</button></div></div>'),
    ('<div class="callout"><h3>Demo scope</h3><p>不申请真实麦克风、不采集声音，译文为预设示例；页面底部常驻免责说明（仅供娱乐，不替代专业行为学分析或兽医诊断）。</p><p class="from-phone">【手机框迁出】语言翻译为本地模拟，不访问麦克风、不采集声音，也不生成真实语音；异常状态需通过右侧「状态演示」手动触发。</p></div>', '<div class="callout"><h3>Demo scope</h3><p>No real microphone application, no sound collection, translation is preset sample; page bottom has permanent disclaimer (for entertainment only, does not replace professional behavior analysis or vet diagnosis).</p><p class="from-phone">[Moved out of phone frame] Language translation is local simulation, no microphone access, no sound collection, no real voice generation; exception status needs to be triggered manually via "Status demo" on the right.</p></div>'),
